      "Visible magenta flecks remain among the MID foliage on both sides and along the distant shrub line, despite zero unresolved pixels reported by intake. The FAR and MID repeat shoreline/root masses; the thin NEAR creates a horizontal texture transition near the bottom. These are visual holds.",
      "The painting suggests depth through a receding shore and detailed outer canopy; native parallax, player silhouette occlusion and underwater-versus-ground habitat suitability remain untested. No quality acceptance is claimed."
